  "objective": {
    "title": "Accruals x Intangibles signal discovery",
    "description": "Discover symbolic equity-return signals that use both themes (accruals and intangibles) for Accruals x Intangibles. The signal should capture an interaction beyond an isolated single-theme effect. Economic story: Intangible-intensive firms can have accounting noise from both expense treatment and accrual components. The task is to separate productive intangible investment from accounting-driven earnings."
